  description:
  - Performing actions and recieving strikes from enemies depletes your stamina.
    You can restore it by eating food or by resting in the town spring.
  - When below 1/4th of max stamina, you may no longer sprint, and any actions the
    player makes will take longer to perform.
  leftText: Instead of eating the entire crop, some creatures deal damage to the
    plant instead. When a crop's health reaches 0 it will die, leaving behind nothing.
    Health can be indicated via a pulsing red flash on a crop.
  rightText: Crops will heal every time they advance a growth stage. Other items,
    such as rocks or trellises, can be applied to a tile, increasing the max health
    of the crop.
